# There is no build step and no dependencies — nothing generated to ignore.
# This file exists to keep OS and editor droppings out of the repo.

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.env.local

# Screenshots and scratch notes used while setting the deploy up. They are
# working artifacts, not part of the app. Committing them would also publish
# them, since Cloudflare Pages serves the whole repo verbatim.
*.png
step3.md

# logo.png is the exception: it is the favicon and the wordmark, so the
# deployed site needs it. Generated from "VuePulse Logo.png" (kept ignored, it
# is the source art) cropped square to the mark and scaled to 256px.
!logo.png

# firebase-config.js is deliberately NOT ignored. Cloudflare Pages serves this
# repo as-is with no build step, so the file has to be committed or the deployed
# site cannot import it. The web API key in it is not a secret, and the repo is
# private. See the README.
